<%= link_to "返回", group_path(@group), class: "text-sm underline-offset-4 hover:underline" %>
<h1 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold">分享</h1>
<p class="mt-4 text-center text-3xl tracking-[0.3em]"><%= @group.public_id %></p>
<button type="button" class="btn-secondary mt-4" data-controller="copy-code" data-copy-code-text-value="<%= @group.public_id %>" data-action="copy-code#copy">复制代号</button>
<div class="mx-auto mt-4 w-full max-w-full overflow-hidden [&_svg]:h-auto [&_svg]:w-full">
  <%= @qr.html_safe %>
</div>
<p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-600">手机用局域网地址打开时通常不能开相机。请输入代号，或用系统相机打开这张二维码。</p>
